From 8991ce3e746171f4028c92e4cc1200fdbd613d1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 15:19:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/35] GENIO: media: platform: mtk-mdp3: add support for
 MT8171 MDP3

Add MT8171 MDP3 platform data and related algorithm settings.
MT8171 no longer uses SCP for calculations, but instead uses the
newly added kernel algorithm to determine the topology, tiles, and
settings of each component.

Change-Id: I538cce7c1a7f5ae7455c138925c566459c66d8f7
Signed-off-by: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
